Package: AirEcuador
Type: Package
Title: Import Air Quality and Meteorological Data from Ecuador
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Fidel", "Vallejo", email = "fidel.vallejo@unach.edu.ec", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Air quality and meteorological observations from Quito's
    Environment Secretariat <https://datosambiente.quito.gob.ec/> and air
    pollutant observations from the Universidad del Azuay station in Cuenca,
    published by IERSE <https://ierse.uazuay.edu.ec/aire/>, are downloaded and
    imported. Station names, missing values, date intervals and optional
    percentile filters are handled consistently. Minute observations from
    Cuenca can be aggregated to hourly means with an explicit completeness
    requirement. Quito monitoring stations can be displayed on an interactive
    map.
